---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Contact – B&G Engineering"
  description="Contact B&G Engineering for mechanical design, fixtures, jigs, DFM and prototyping support."
>
  <section class="hero compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Send a short description of the engineering task.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      If you need external mechanical design support for a manufacturing,
      automation, fixture, jig, DFM or prototyping project, a few basic details
      are enough for the first discussion.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>Useful information to include</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>project goal,</li>
      <li>available CAD model, drawing or reference geometry,</li>
      <li>required timeline,</li>
      <li>whether the goal is a prototype, one-off part or small batch,</li>
      <li>manufacturing, assembly or material constraints.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:lguba71@hotmail.com">lguba71@hotmail.com</a>
    </p>
    <p class="note">
      Temporary contact address until the bgengineering.hu domain email is configured.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
